OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FSunday will get off to a cloudy
OL,6,Fand breezy start with some showery
OL,7,Frain. The showers will become more
OL,8,Fscattered through the morning and for
OL,9,Fthe afternoon, with some warm brighter
OL,10,Fspells developing at times.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FThere will be bright spells
OL,13,Fand a few showers to end the day.
OL,14,FClear spells will develop overnight,
OL,15,Fwith isolated showers lingering in the
OL,16,Fnorth. Remaining fairly breezy, though
OL,17,Fmild.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
