OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CMonday:FApart from an early light
OL,6,Fshower in the north, Monday promises
OL,7,Fto be generally dry with bright or
OL,8,Fsunny spells. Feeling quite warm in
OL,9,Fthe westerly breeze.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FBar
OL,12,Fan isolated shower, the weather looks
OL,13,Fmostly dry and settled during the
OL,14,Fperiod. There will be plenty of
OL,15,Fsunshine, and it will feel increasing
OL,16,Fwarm again in lighter winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
